# kin/child/hair/tuft: the child's Tousled tuft: one pixel up from the crown (the hair's rise, STYLE_P2 3)
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to KIN-CHILD in wave 2). The child, 21 px (STYLE_P2 3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body child
role hair tousled
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys rest
z 1
tags overlay mirror-ok

view D key rest origin -5 1
|a

view U key rest origin -6 1
|a

view R key rest origin -5 1
|a

view L key rest origin -6 1
|a
